<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-007" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-007-xietiao-donghun" source-id="s-nanqishu-007-xietiao-donghun-ws2438183">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-007-xietiao-donghun:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">東昏侯<persName id="c-nanqishu-007-xietiao-donghun:p001:m0003" ref="w4m_9tw_147_A">寶卷</persName>字智藏，高宗第二子也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-007-xietiao-donghun:p002" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter">庚申，鎮北將軍晉安王<persName id="c-nanqishu-007-xietiao-donghun:p002:m0010" ref="w4m_9tw_147_C">寶義</persName>進號征北大將軍、開府儀同三司。</p>
</text>
